<title>USA: Fed says overnight RPs totaled $2.635 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight RPs totaled $2.635 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it added $2.635 billion to the banking system via overnight system repurchase agreements on Thursday.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660))</p>
